# Mazak VQC 20/40 — Post-GUI HAL
# Loaded by mazak_vqc_20_40.ini (POSTGUI_HALFILE) AFTER the GUI starts.
# Connect halui.* / pyvcp.* / gladevcp.* pins here — they do not exist until the GUI
# is up, so they cannot go in the main HAL files.

# --- Warning panel (panel_warnings.xml, [DISPLAY] PYVCP) ---
# OWNER DECISION 2026-09-05 (config-audit item 16c): these three safety-chain
# inputs are WARNING-ONLY - an LED each, no interlock consequence. Signals are
# produced in field_7i84u.hal; this file only adds the panel as a consumer.
# LED is GREEN when the input reads TRUE (believed = NC chain closed = healthy).
# Polarity unverified on all three: bench items 47 (IN8) / 8 (IN24) / 11 (IN25).
net thermal-alarm    => pyvcp.thermal-ok
net door-interlock   => pyvcp.door-closed
net lube-ok          => pyvcp.lube-ok

# (add further halui.* / panel connections here once the pendant/HMI is defined)
